flowchart TD
    %% Level 1 DFD - Payment Data Flow Only
    %% Simple view: external entities, processes, data stores
    %% Based on DATA_FLOW_DIAGRAM.md Process 3.0 Payment Processing

    SR[Sales Representative]
    PA[Pharmacist/Admin]
    EPG[External Payment Gateway]

    P1[1.0 Submit Payment]
    P2[2.0 Verify Payment]
    P3[3.0 Reject Payment]

    D1[(D1: Payment Submission)]
    D2[(D2: Transaction)]
    D3[(D3: File Upload)]

    %% Sales Rep: submit payment info
    SR -->|Payment info| P1
    SR -->|Payment receipt| P1
    P1 -->|Submission| D1
    P1 -->|Receipt file| D3
    D1 -->|Submissions| P1
    P1 -->|Confirmation| SR

    %% Pharmacist: verify or reject
    PA -->|Verify request| P2
    D1 -->|Pending submissions| P2
    P2 -->|Verified status| D1
    P2 -->|Transaction record| D2
    P2 -->|Verification status| SR
    P2 -->|Verification status| PA

    PA -->|Reject request| P3
    D1 -->|Pending submissions| P3
    P3 -->|Rejected status| D1
    P3 -->|Rejection notice| SR

    %% Gateway (optional flow)
    EPG -->|Gateway response| P2
    P2 -->|Payment request| EPG

    classDef entity fill:#e1f5ff,stroke:#0066cc
    classDef process fill:#fff4e1,stroke:#ff6600
    classDef store fill:#e1ffe1,stroke:#00cc00
    class SR,PA,EPG entity
    class P1,P2,P3 process
    class D1,D2,D3 store
